  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag636" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;!--?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="no"?--&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 12pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;1. General&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We are a Delaware limited liability company formed on January 10, 2013. When we refer to "us," "we," "our," "the Company," or "Sierrita" we are describing Sierrita Gas Pipeline LLC.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Members' interests in Sierrita are as follows:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 14pt; margin-left: 111.95pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;35% - Kinder Morgan Operating LLC "A", an indirect subsidiary of Kinder Morgan, Inc.;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 111.95pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;35% - MGI Enterprises US LLC, a subsidiary of Petroleos Mexicanos; and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 111.95pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-indent: -18pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&amp;#61623;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-size: 7pt;"&gt; &amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;30% - MIT Pipeline Investment Americas, Inc., a subsidiary of Mitsui &amp;amp; Co., LTD.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;We have prepared our accompanying financial statements in accordance with the accounting requirements of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts and published accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than accounting principles generally accepted in the United States of America (US GAAP). In management&amp;#8217;s opinion, these financial statements reflect normal and recurring adjustments that are necessary for a fair presentation of our financial results for the interim periods presented, and adequate disclosures have been made to make the information presented not misleading. These interim financial statements should be read along with the financial statements and related notes included in our 2025 Annual Report of Major Natural Gas Companies on Form No. 2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Management has evaluated subsequent events through August 26, 2026, the date the financial statements were available to be issued.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;2. Related Party Transactions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
